{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_st04",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_st04",
  "title": "In the Name of Love",
  "storyCode": "OF-ST4",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c5e96e5152adf954e13b3ba0cf350f5053aa791e4fecee2e5d4dffb453d373af",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, you knew all along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "How long did you expect this lie to last?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": "char_290_vigna",
      "operatorId": "char_290_vigna",
      "portraitKey": "char_290_vigna",
      "text": "Ohh, the concert is about to start..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the Obsidian Festival!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you all having a great time?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Audience",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Thunderous cheering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a warm reception! But let me tell you something - you don't know anything about the true charm of the Obsidian Festival yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tonight, all the musicians that have been invited here will come together to bring you a feast for your senses!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One main stage. Four large stages. Twelve small stages. Forty musicians from all kinds of genres will keep the show going for eighteen straight hours until the sun rises tomorrow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell me now, ARE YOU READY?!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Audience",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Thunderous cheering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "...Ceylon told me about the situation with the volcano."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
      "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "You tampered with the station's data and even accused Miss Ceylon of spreading false rumors."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's because we both know. We both know about what Herman did!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just say it then, if you already know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go on, Cronin. But make sure to also tell them what you did when I was 'out on business.' Tell them everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "F-Father...?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you doing here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Surprised to see me, Cronin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After I banned obsidian mining, there has still been a steady influx of fresh obsidian into the market."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The mining team has been seen many times at the volcano's entrance, but nobody reported anything to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The resources they mined would be transferred numerous times before finally arriving at the City Hall's abandoned warehouse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Despite the fact that I set aside funding to provide support for the various Oripathy patients who came to Siesta, I learned that they were actually suffering from discrimination throughout the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does this news surprise you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tsk..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, hearing about it made my blood boil!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In order to find out the truth, I pretended to leave the city and asked Schwarz to investigate for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "Looks like just investigating these records on the relevant personnel was enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Mister Hellagur, you're all safe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a pity, Cronin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Originally, I was not opposed to sharing things with you, but you were too impatient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Me? Impatient?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everything I did was for the sake of this city! You were the one who taught me that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened to the Baru family ten years ago, the collapse of the television station eight years ago, and the way you persuaded..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or, should I say, 'annexed?' Yes, the way you annexed the Tarak Tribe. I know all about these things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everything I've done, I learned from you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Exploit, and abandon. Use any means necessary. The ends justify the means."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you know all the sweat, blood, and tears I've poured into this shabby hole? And what did I get in return?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We worked so hard to mine the volcano and finally managed to improve our situation, but what did you do? You squandered it all to subsidize those incurable Infected!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If that's going to be the case, I'd prefer an eruption! All I need is to protect the true value of Siesta, and then I shall rise once again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "True that I've done many things in the past. But never have I wagered the fate of Siesta."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think about the lives of the miners and researchers, about the lives of everyone living in this city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cronin, you're fired."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ahahahahaha! You senile fool, I wouldn't be so sure about that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks to your delusional prattling, my men have all assembled!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ifrit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm? Wait a sec, how'd I burn it already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ifrit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Matterhorn! Take a look at this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ifrit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What the heck... It feels like the temperature flow has changed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gummy",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Woaaaah! Huge waves!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gummy",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait! They're getting even bigger! That's way too crazy, ahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Why are you all quiet now? Don't you normally love to run your mouth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "I'm thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Huh, never thought I'd see the day when you of all people would be stunned speechless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "My mind is racing. Give me a second to calm down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "No, I'm not a geologist, nor do I know anything about Originium physics or high-energy Originium Arts, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "High-energy Arts has nothing to do with the ecology of a volcano. I doubt that stuff is going to fix our problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "If there's no other way, maybe I can create a giant vessel and transfer all the energy into it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "But I'd need several years to draft Arts like that. Impossible, that's not gonna work at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "I have no idea about any of that! But what I do know is, we're in serious trouble! Very serious trouble!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Of course we are! Otherwise, why would I get excited?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Hurry up and figure something out then!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "What do you think I'm doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "I need to let the Doctor know right away..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "So please think faster. I'll send the message right now! Also, don't let the heat short-circuit your brain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "I'm keeping my cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "You just said you were excited! Look, even your hair is on fire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm, massive geological shifts caused by a disruption of the ecological chain... Aha! It's not doomsday just yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
